oto"],"location":{"lat":26.44922,"lng":80.30828},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kanpur_wv_shri_radha_krishna_temple","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":2,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-21"},"hashtags":["shriradhakrishnatemple","kanpur"],"summary":"Wonderful piece of architecture and art and you must see this monument if you visit Kanpur. The Temple has statues of Lord Krishna, Lord Shiva, Lord Hanuman, Lord Vishnu, and Lord Rama. The illuminated towers of the temple can be seen from quite a distance at night. On Sundays, it is usually very crowded at summers as people try to get some relief from the high temperatures in the greenery and ope","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Kanpur","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Mango_Shake_of_Kanpur_Chawla_Chauraha.jpg/1280px-Mango_Shake_of_Kanpur_Chawla_Chauraha.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Mango_Shake_of_Kanpur_Chawla_Chauraha.jpg/500px-Mango_Shake_of_Kanpur_Chawla_Chauraha.jpg","w":1200,"h":1600,"author":"Apurba Biswas","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mango_Shake_of_Kanpur_Chawla_Chauraha.jpg"}},{"id":"kanpur_wv_isckon_temple","areaId":"kanpur","name":"ISCKON Temple","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":26.5269,"lng":80.2779},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kanpur_wv_isckon_temple","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://iskconkanpur.com/wp/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":1,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-21"},"hashtags":["isckontemple","kanpur"],"summary":"It is a Radha Krishna temple on Mainawati Marg, Bithoor Road. There is also a restaurant named Govinda's.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Kanpur","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Isckon_temple%2C_Kanpur.jpg/1280px-Isckon_tem